{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlesExternalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"matching"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"conditions"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This modifier is only supported for WindowGroup Scene types."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For DocumentGroups, the received External Event must have a URL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the DocumentGroup to be considered. (Either via openURL, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the webPageURL property of an NSUserActivity). The UTI for the URL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is implicitly matched against the DocumentGroup’s supported types."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the modifier evaluates to true, an instance of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Scene will be used."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the modifier evaluates to false, on macOS the Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will not be used even if no other Scenes are available."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This case is considered an error. On iOS, the first Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specified in the body property for the App will be used."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If no modifier is set, the Scene will be used if all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other WindowGroups with a modifier evaluate to false."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms that only allow a single Window\/Scene, this method is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/swift\/never\/handlesexternalevents(matching:)"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Specifies a modifier to indicate if this Scene can be used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when creating a new Scene for the received External Event."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift\/Never\/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift\/Never"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE21handlesExternalEvents8matchingQrShySSG_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:s5NeverO","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handlesExternalEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"matching","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"